    },
    "Architects collect references constantly — a façade, a joint, a book spread, a model. Archipic turns that habit into a structured, searchable archive: photograph it, answer two quick questions, and your library organises itself by what things are and where you found them. Everything stays on your device and syncs privately through your iCloud." : {
